1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
One stroke, no undo — the ink is forever.
一笔落下，无法重来

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Chinese calligraphy hides a mistake nowhere.
中国书法，藏不住一点错

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
It runs on four treasures: brush, ink, paper, stone.
靠"文房四宝"：笔墨纸砚

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
The brush never lands the same way twice.
每一笔的力道都不同

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
In 353, Wang Xizhi wrote it a little drunk.
公元353年，王羲之微醺挥毫

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Double-tap if your handwriting could never do this.
觉得自己写不出的，点个赞

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
That draft became China's finest running script.
那份草稿，成了天下第一行书

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,800
Legend says he never matched it sober again.
传说酒醒后，他再难写出第二份

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,000
★ Expert Tip: In China, ask for xuan paper — it drinks ink like nothing else.
内行贴士：在中国就找"宣纸"，最吃墨

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Would you sign in ink that can't be fixed?
换你，敢用改不了的墨签名吗
